	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「元祖ドラえもん」がFigure-rise Mechanicsにラインアップ！",
			"• 黄色いボディを成形色で再現し、元祖ドラえもんの特徴的な耳も新規造形で再現。",
			"• 口を別パーツにすることでシールレスを実現。さらに作りやすくなった！",
			"• クリアパーツ外装付属で、内部メカが丸わかり！",
			"• 「タケコプター」が付属！別売りの「Figure-rise Mechanicsドラえもん」にもつけられるタケコプター取り付け用パーツも付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"Original Doraemon\" is now available in Figure-rise Mechanics!",
			"• The yellow body is reproduced in molding color, and the distinctive ears of the original Doraemon are also reproduced with new modeling.",
			"• Seal-less is achieved by making the mouth a separate part. It's even easier to make!",
			"• Comes with clear parts for the exterior, allowing you to fully understand the internal mechanism!",
			"• \"Takecopter\" is included! Also included are Takecopter mounting parts that can be attached to the separately sold \"Figure-rise Mechanics Doraemon\"."
		]
	},
